[["قُلْ هُوَ ٱللَّهُ أَحَدٌ","Say, \"He is Allah, [who is] One,","Qul huwal laahu ahad"],["ٱللَّهُ ٱلصَّمَدُ","Allah, the Eternal Refuge.","Allah hus-samad"],["لَمْ يَلِدْ وَلَمْ يُولَدْ","He neither begets nor is born,","Lam yalid wa lam yoolad"],["وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُۥ كُفُوًا أَحَدٌۢ","Nor is there to Him any equivalent.\"","Wa lam yakul-lahu kufuwan ahad"]]